DESCRIPTION:Nataly Aukar is a Lebanese born and raised writer and performer
  based in NYC. As a stand-up comic\, Nataly has toured the world headlinin
 g sold out theaters across the US\, Europe and the Middle East. She was fe
 atured in the Netflix is a Joke Festival as part of the “Introducing…
 ” showcase and on Don’t Tell Comedy. Nataly can be seen in the Netfli
 x feature The Life List\, directed by Adam Brooks and just wrapped the indi
 e feature Skit written and directed by Badr Mastrouq and Des Lombardo. She
  was also recently featured on Vulture's 2025 'The Comedians You Should an
 d Will Know.Nataly is touring her brand new hour around North America\, Eur
 ope\, the Middle East and Australia.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/c
 omedy-atlas/event/nataly-aukar-23423/
